# BECOMING — UI/UX DESIGN DOCUMENT

> **Brand Concept:** Senti CRM Branding-inspired Luxury Editorial × Soft Feminine Wellness × Modern Productivity & Personal Growth Platform.
> **Tagline:** *Become who you want to be. One ordinary day at a time.*

---

## 1. Design Vision

**BECOMING** should feel like:
**A luxury editorial magazine + personal operating system + modern wellness app.**

The interface should make users feel:
> “I want to live this life.”

rather than:
> “I have another productivity app I need to maintain.”

---

## 2. Visual Direction

| Element | Direction |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Overall** | Premium, luxury editorial, minimal, architectural |
| **Mood** | Calm, confident, aspirational, warm, grounded |
| **Layout** | Asymmetrical editorial grids, modular panels, layered floating cards |
| **Typography** | Dramatic large serif headlines + clean refined geometric sans-serif |
| **Cards** | 20–28px soft rounded cards, layered compositions, subtle border lines |
| **Photography** | Candid, cinematic lifestyle, quiet morning rituals, coffee, books, golden hour |
| **Animation** | Slow, subtle, 300–500ms smooth cubic-bezier transitions, delicate hover lifts |
| **UI Density** | Spacious, intentional whitespace, zero cluttered SaaS feeling |

---

## 3. Color System

Inspired by the Senti design system, softened into a warm, feminine, high-fashion identity:

### Primary
* **Warm Ivory:** `#F7F3ED` (Canvas background)
* **Deep Espresso:** `#211A18` (Primary typography & strong accents)
* **Canvas Cream:** `#FAF4F4` / `#FDFBF7`

### Secondary
* **Dusty Rose:** `#C99A9A` / `#9F5154`
* **Muted Sage:** `#AAB5A1`
* **Warm Peach:** `#E8BFA9`
* **Soft Cocoa:** `#8C7065`
* **Warm Stone / Sand:** `#BBA395`

### Accent
* **Deep Burgundy:** `#5B1B1D` (Key action triggers, active pill states, editorial badges)
* **Velvet Noir:** `#0C0302`

---

## 4. Typography

### Headings
* **Font Family:** `Playfair Display`, `Cormorant Garamond`, `DM Serif Display`
* **Style:** High-contrast editorial serif, generous line height, italic accents.
* **Example:**
  > *Become the woman you're building.*

### Body & Interface
* **Font Family:** `Plus Jakarta Sans`, `Inter`, `Manrope`, `Outfit`
* **Style:** Crisp, legible, modern geometric sans-serif with 500/600 weight metrics.

This creates the signature contrast: **High-Fashion Editorial × Intuitive Technology**.

---

## 5. Homepage / Landing Flow

The homepage immediately communicates the philosophy with cinematic impact.

### Hero
* **Large Typography:**
  # BECOME WHO YOU WANT TO BE.
* **Supporting Text:**
  *Build your habits. Keep your promises. Create a life you actually love.*
* **Primary Action:** `[ Start Becoming ]`
* **Right Visual Composition:**
  Large cinematic lifestyle imagery with overlapping floating cards:
  * Floating Card 1: `78% Consistency · 23 Days Showed Up`
  * Floating Card 2: `Today's Identity: "I keep promises to myself."`

---

## 6. Dashboard (My Day)

An editorial modular layout inspired by luxury brand books:

### Header
> **Good morning, Anna.**
> *Today is another chance to become her.*

### Editorial Grid Composition
* **Panel 1 — Identity Callout:**
  > **YOUR IDENTITY**
  > *“I am someone who keeps promises to herself.”*
* **Panel 2 — Today's Core Focus:**
  * ○ Study for 2 hours (Machine Learning)
  * ○ 30-minute Movement session
  * ○ Evening 5-minute Journal
* **Panel 3 — Life Balance Metrics:**
  * **MIND:** `72%`
  * **BODY:** `84%`
  * **FUTURE:** `61%`

---

## 7. “BECOME” Page (Identity Architecture)

The philosophical core of the platform:
* **Large Headline:** *Who are you becoming?*
* **Identity Statement Cards:**
  * **DISCIPLINED:** *“I do what I said I would do.”*
  * **CONFIDENT:** *“I trust myself to handle difficult things.”*
  * **HEALTHY:** *“I take care of my body with nourishment and sleep.”*
  * **CURIOUS:** *“I keep learning and exploring.”*
* **Identity ➔ Behavior Mapping:**
  ```text
  CONFIDENT
     ↓ Speak up in class & meetings
     ↓ Exercise 4x weekly
     ↓ Try new cultural experiences
     ↓ Keep daily promises to herself
  ```

---

## 8. Goals Page (Life Stories, Not Jira Tickets)

Visual story cards connecting 90-day ambitions to today's physical action:

* **Goal Card Example:**
  * **Title:** BECOME A BETTER STUDENT & MASTER TECH
  * **Progress:** `68% Complete`
  * **Story Milestones:** Study consistently · Improve grades · Read more · Build focus
  * **Hierarchy:**
    * `90-DAY VISION:` Master CS fundamentals & build confidence
    * `MONTHLY TARGET:` 30 hours of deep study
    * `WEEKLY TARGET:` 8 hours focused study weekly
    * `TODAY'S ACTION:` Complete 2-hour assignment

---

## 9. Routine Page (Timelines & Grace)

Clean, spacious timeline layout with thin lines and subtle icons:

### Morning Rhythm (Dawn)
* `07:00` — Gentle Wake up
* `07:10` — Water + Skincare ritual
* `07:30` — Morning walk in fresh air
* `08:00` — Nourishing protein breakfast
* `08:30` — Set Today's Top 3 & begin focus

### Evening Rhythm (Dusk)
* `18:00` — Movement & workout
* `19:00` — Peaceful dinner
* `20:00` — Deep study session
* `21:30` — 10 pages reading & herbal tea
* `22:30` — Journal reflection & wind-down

---

## 10. “LIVE” Page (Pinterest × Editorial Lifestyle Magazine)

The platform's key differentiator:
* **Headline:** *Don't forget to live.*
* **Curated Experience Cards with Imagery:**
  * ☕ *Try a new aesthetic café*
  * 🌅 *Watch the golden hour sunset*
  * 🎨 *Make something with your hands*
  * 👯 *Cozy dinner with close friends*
  * 🎬 *Late night movie & candles*
  * 🌿 *Take yourself on a solo museum date*

---

## 11. Progress Page (Emotional Narrative)

* **Hero Metrics:**
  * `23` Days Showed Up
  * `78%` Overall Consistency
  * `12` Goals Progressed
  * `4` Habits Maintained
* **30-Day Presence Calendar:** Non-punitive heatmap (*Completed, Partial/Showed Up, Rest & Restore, Missed*).
* **The Narrative Payoff:**
  * **30 Days Ago:** *“You were struggling to stay consistent and overwhelmed by phone scrolling.”*
  * **Today:** *“You're building a routine you can actually maintain and keeping promises to yourself.”*
  * **Next Chapter:** *“Deepen emotional calmness and unshakeable self-trust.”*

---

## 12. Reset Mode

Soft, restorative, full-screen calm modal:
> **“You don't have to start over. You just need one good day.”**

### Today's Reset:
* ☐ Make your bed & reset desk
* ☐ Drink 2L water throughout the day
* ☐ 20-minute focus session on ONE thing
* ☐ 15-minute walk outside
* ☐ Sleep on time with zero guilt
* `[ I'm Showing Up Again ]`

---

## 13. Navigation & Actions

* **Desktop:** `BECOMING` · Home · Become · Goals · Routine · Grow · Live · Journal · Profile · `[ + Quick Action ]` · `[ Reset Mode ]`
* **Mobile:** Bottom bar `Home` · `Goals` · `[ + ]` · `Grow` · `Me`
* **The `+` Quick Action Modal:** One-tap logging for Habit, Goal Action, Journal Reflection, or Life Experience.

---

## 14. Photography & Cinematography Direction

* Unsplash curated editorial imagery: Candid morning light, iced matcha, vintage books, serene minimal architecture, flowers, solo city walks, quiet studying, sunset skies.
* No generic corporate stock photography.

---

## 15. Core Design Principle

> **Don't design a productivity app. Design a life.**
>
> 1. *Who am I becoming?*
> 2. *What matters to me?*
> 3. *What should I do today?*
> 4. *Am I showing up?*
> 5. *Am I growing?*
> 6. *Am I actually living?*
